<title>JAPAN: Nissan Fire &amp; Marine - 96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Nissan Fire &amp; Marine - 96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenue	    426.15		vs	  417.47</p>
<p> Current	     11.42		vs	   15.06</p>
<p> Net		    4.02		vs	    3.44</p>
<p> EPS		   19.22 yen	  vs	   16.84 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	 16.84 yen	  vs	   16.67 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nissan Fire and Marine Insurance Co Ltd is a non-life insurance company and is particularly involved in car insurance.</p>
